                  "text": "Eze 26:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwanadamu, Nebukadneza, mfalme wa Babeli, alilifanyisha jeshi lake kazi ngumu juu ya Tiro; kila kichwa kilitiwa upara, na kila bega liliambuliwa ngozi, lakini hakuna mshahara uliotoka Tiro, sio wake wala wa jeshi lake, kwa kazi ile aliyofanya juu yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
