              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Bwana MUNGU asema hivi; Tazama, nitampa Nebukadneza, mfalme wa Babeli, hiyo nchi ya Misri; naye atawachukua watu wake jamii yote pia, na kutwaa mateka yake, na kutwaa mawindo yake, nayo yatakuwa ndio mshahara wa jeshi lake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
